ke it's a game changer to  have the console  running off of an external hard drive  compared to what you're used to with the  current generation you'll be fine  i think most of the questions i honestly  do have are all about the sound so yeah  this thing's really quiet  that's that's the biggest thing it is  really quiet  got a lot of questions about  refrigerators  oh my god this video quality is so bad  because i don't have a light  i'm so sorry everyone uh oh someone said  how heavy would you say it is  um i actually don't think it's very  heavy at all it's big  but it's very easy to carry it is very  light to carry so i had no problems  where that's concerned whatsoever  and i think that's pretty much it  everyone i will take any of the  questions here that i didn't have the  answers to  and uh get those answers and just keep  making content about it for sure over  the next  several weeks so if you have more  questions feel free to leave them below  i will basically make dedicated videos  for the things that people are asking to  see  is my plan just trying to inform as much  as i can alright  that's it for me today everyone i'm  sorry about the video quality  but it is what it is i'll see you guys  next time bye
 

